    {
      "id": "2124582428467441773",
      "text": "The Saints have forced their first turnover since October 18, when Carl Granderson tipped a Caleb Williams pass at the LOS and Danny Stutsman picked it off. Was talking to Kaden Elliss about that this week, and he said they just haven't forced many chances like that.",
      "url": "https://x.com/ByLukeJohnson/status/2124582428467441773",
      "published": "2026-11-22T19:14:58+00:00",
      "likes": 4,
      "author": "Luke Johnson",
