      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2124582320774815834",
      "text": "And right on cue. Tip drill interception. Saints take over. We’re officially in the middle 8. First career INT for Danny Stutsman.",
      "url": "https://x.com/Jeff_Nowak/status/2124582320774815834",
      "published": "2026-11-22T19:14:32+00:00",
      "likes": 13,
      "author": "Jeff Nowak",
      "handle": "Jeff_Nowak",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2089567434491703296/HvgeZn2f_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "This game felt close to getting out of hand. Saints defense has a chance to build momentum here. Out of bounds kickoff gives it back at the 40.",
      "quoted_author": "Jeff Nowak",
      "quoted_handle": "Jeff_Nowak"
    },
    {
