    {
      "id": "2124582172937904479",
      "text": "That 46-yard run by Etienne is the first 40+ yard rush by a #Saints running back since Alvin Kamara's 49-yard rush against the Packer in 2020. First overall since Taysom Hill's 75-yard run in 2024 vs. the Browns",
